1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,200
{\an8}THE KEEPERS

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,725
Between 1861 and 1974, someone lived on this rock.

3
00:00:07,125 --> 00:00:09,875
Never fewer than two. Never more than three.

4
00:00:10,275 --> 00:00:13,713
The rule was two, because one keeper alone is a rumour.

5
00:00:14,113 --> 00:00:18,488
<i>Archive: a man in oilskins waves at a camera he does not trust.</i>

6
00:00:18,888 --> 00:00:21,138
The lamp burned paraffin until 1953.

7
00:00:21,537 --> 00:00:25,475
A keeper carried it up ninety-seven stairs, four times a night.

8
00:00:25,875 --> 00:00:28,812
- Was it heavy?
- It was heavy the fourth time.

9
00:00:29,212 --> 00:00:31,837
That is Elena Vasi, keeper here from 1968.

10
00:00:32,237 --> 00:00:35,675
The last woman on the rock, and the last person off it.

11
00:00:36,075 --> 00:00:37,762
The light is automatic now.

12
00:00:38,162 --> 00:00:40,787
It has been automatic for fifty-one years.

13
00:00:41,187 --> 00:00:42,750
It has not gone out once.

14
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:47,150
<i>She laughs at this for longer than the question deserves.</i>

15
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:50,175
Ours went out. Ours went out every winter.

16
00:00:50,575 --> 00:00:51,775
And you fixed it.

17
00:00:52,175 --> 00:00:54,425
We warmed it. There is a difference.

18
00:00:54,825 --> 00:00:58,200
In 1974 the last keepers were taken off by helicopter.

19
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:00,912
They were given nine minutes to pack.

20
00:01:01,312 --> 00:01:03,875
Elena took a kettle and a tin of buttons.

21
00:01:04,275 --> 00:01:06,525
- Why buttons?
- They were not mine.

22
00:01:06,925 --> 00:01:09,613
They belonged to a keeper who left in 1931.

23
00:01:10,013 --> 00:01:11,388
She had never met him.

24
00:01:11,788 --> 00:01:14,038
Someone has to keep a man's buttons.

25
00:01:14,438 --> 00:01:18,063
<i>The rock, from the air. The light turns for nobody.</i>

26
00:01:18,463 --> 00:01:20,588
It still turns every four seconds.

27
00:01:20,988 --> 00:01:22,300
It will turn tonight.

